SLLM patch 7 (phase 2 prefillattn): GQA-packed prefill flash attention (pfa): kernels/prefill.metal (new kind "prefill"),
ggml-metal-pfa.{h,m} (plan, encoder, self-test, status, SLLM_PREFILL_CASCADE) and its hooks (source list, library kind,
compile-failure note, init call, FLASH_ATTN_EXT branch after the decode cascade's, scratch). Per row the kernel does ggml's
kernel_flash_attn_ext_tensor arithmetic, so its output is bitwise ggml's (checked by the init self-test).
Against llama.cpp b11669 (source tarball 620d222) after patches 1-6, applied with patch -p1 in ggml/. Adds lines, except three of
the hooks of patches 2 and 4 (the library kind list and the compile-failure branch, which now also name the prefill kind).

